  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland&apos;s Core Contribution to UNHCR for 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Core Contribution to UNHCR to support their strategic objectives in line with the 2025 Global Appeal which plans for 139 million forcibly displaced people worlwwide. UNHCR&apos;s Global Appeal aims to deliver under four impact areas: 1) Attaining favourable protection environments; 2) Realising rights in safe environments; 3) Empowering communities and achieving gender equality; 4) Securing solutions. This includes activities in support of specific outcome areas including: gender-based violence, child prection, community engagement and women&apos;s empowerment, housing, education and health.</narrative>
  </description>
